{color.GG}$__config__/atop.conf {color.N}is the default configuration file for ATop.
It controls the refresh interval and the maximum number of processes displayed.

Example config:
{color.DG}# comment{color.GG}
{color.PP}refreshms {color.N}= {color.YY}1000{color.N}
{color.PP}maxprocess {color.N}= {color.YY}50{color.N}

Note:
    {color.R}- {color.PP}maxprocess {color.N}= {color.YY}- {color.N}disables the process limit.